OL,3,GNEWSAUpdated plans for retirement
OL,4,Acommunity approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FUpdated plans for a retirement village
OL,7,Fin Surrey with 49 bungalows around a
OL,8,Fcare hub have been approved by
OL,9,Fcouncillors.
OL,11,FThe plans were originally approved in
OL,12,FJanuary but returned before Surrey
OL,13,FHeath Borough Council on Thursday to
OL,14,Fimprove accessibility, according to the
OL,15,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service.
OL,17,FAt the location on St Catherines Road,
OL,18,Fin Frimley, there will also be on-site
OL,19,Fcare staff, plus a lounge, garden and
OL,20,Fan activities room for residents aged
OL,21,F65 and above.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
